              <ul>
                <li>Docker Compose on a Linux host</li>
                <li>Postgres 16 with <code>pgvector</code> (bundled)</li>
                <li>A domain — Caddy handles TLS</li>
                <li>Two secrets: <code>JWT_SECRET</code>, <code>POSTGRES_PASSWORD</code></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="req reveal" style="transition-delay:0.1s">
              <h3>Optional &amp; inert until set</h3>
              <ul>
                <li><code>REDIS_URL</code> — multi-replica fanout</li>
                <li><code>LIVEKIT_*</code> — voice, video, screen share</li>
                <li><code>S3_*</code> — uploads on your own bucket</li>
                <li><code>AI_*</code> — Sharpy, embeddings, transcription</li>
                <li><code>GOOGLE_*</code>, <code>GITHUB_*</code> — calendar &amp; task sync</li>
                <li><code>RESEND_API_KEY</code> or <code>SMTP_*</code> — password reset</li>
              </ul>
